{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19956","headline":"游石龙涡 · 孟郊","name":"游石龙涡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石龙不见形，石雨如散星。\n山下晴皎皎，山中阴泠泠。\n水飞林木杪，珠缀莓苔屏。\n畜异物皆别，当晨景欲暝。\n泉芳春气碧，松月寒色青。\n险力此独壮，猛兽亦不停。\n日暮且回去，浮心恨未宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}